WEBVTT

00:00.587 --> 00:09.444
kanashige ni saku hana ni kimi no omokage wo mita

00:00.587 --> 00:09.444
I saw your image in the flower that is blossoming sorrowfully

00:09.957 --> 00:18.529
daisuki na ame nanoni naze ka kyou wa tsumetakute

00:09.957 --> 00:18.529
I love rain, yet it felt frosty today

00:18.671 --> 00:37.246
kisetsu wa meguri mori wa somerare kaze wa kanadete omoi afurete

00:18.671 --> 00:37.246
The season changed, the forest was colored, the wind played a tune, memories overflowed

00:37.620 --> 00:46.806
tsuki no kakera wo atsumete yume wo kazari nemuru

00:37.620 --> 00:46.807
Gather the pieces of the moon, decorate the dream and sleep

00:47.040 --> 00:56.173
toki no suna chiribametemo ano koro e kaeranai

00:47.040 --> 00:56.174
Even if I sprinkle the sand of time, I cannot return to the past

00:56.333 --> 01:05.440
ikiru imi sageshiteiru dare mo mina tabibito

00:56.333 --> 01:05.440
Those searching for the meaning of life are all travellers

01:05.789 --> 01:14.837
haruka naru tabiji tadori boku wa ima arukidasu

01:05.796 --> 01:14.837
I set my course on this endless journey

01:14.857 --> 01:22.832
ibara no michi no mukou e...

01:14.857 --> 01:22.832
for the place beyond the thorny path...

01:25.763 --> 01:30.736
The artist of life who produces miracles
with his godlike scalpel skills.

01:31.644 --> 01:34.145
The surgeon whom this era has yearned for.

01:34.855 --> 01:36.439
Black Jack.

01:48.786 --> 01:51.955
Originally "The Shoplifting Dog” by Tezuka Osamu.

01:48.866 --> 01:51.960
The Dog Thief

01:56.191 --> 01:57.245
Doc,

01:57.487 --> 02:03.605
I prepared lots of wonderful food to celebrate our wedding anniversary.

02:03.683 --> 02:06.768
Pinoco, your cooking really is the best.

02:06.769 --> 02:08.866
I'm such a lucky man.

02:13.693 --> 02:16.987
Geez! You're destroying the image I had!

02:16.988 --> 02:22.159
I'm trying to prepare you to be
a good husband in the future!

02:22.160 --> 02:25.370
Girls won't like you if you act like that!

02:25.746 --> 02:27.914
This is boring.

02:27.915 --> 02:29.749
Let's play something else.

02:30.209 --> 02:31.918
Like what?

02:31.919 --> 02:33.799
Astro Boy saves the Earth!

02:34.046 --> 02:38.717
I'll play Astro and slay the evil space invaders!

02:44.348 --> 02:47.142
I hate violence.

02:47.351 --> 02:48.935
Such a lie.

02:48.936 --> 02:51.605
Pinoco-chan! Sharaku!

02:54.542 --> 02:55.642
Wato-san.

02:55.682 --> 02:56.682
Onee-chan.

02:59.363 --> 03:02.887
Why are you playing so close to the fence?

03:03.326 --> 03:04.659
Because... See?

03:04.998 --> 03:05.867
Ready?

03:05.931 --> 03:07.085
Stand back!

03:07.580 --> 03:07.954
There!

03:10.249 --> 03:12.584
You're not allowed to play baseball here.

03:12.585 --> 03:13.919
I'll go complain.

03:15.463 --> 03:16.838
Hey, you guys.

03:17.298 --> 03:19.257
Stop playing baseball!

03:19.532 --> 03:20.634
Why?

03:20.635 --> 03:23.970
The smaller kids can't play here because of you!

03:24.472 --> 03:25.472
Shut up!

03:25.514 --> 03:26.890
So what?

03:26.891 --> 03:30.143
We're only playing baseball!

03:27.186 --> 03:28.936
Oh, a puppy.

03:29.156 --> 03:30.120
It's coming this way.

03:30.144 --> 03:33.146
But you aren't supposed to play baseball in this park.

03:33.147 --> 03:37.525
None of the other kids can play because
you're hoarding all the space.

03:37.526 --> 03:41.288
You're in junior high, you should know better.

03:41.530 --> 03:43.406
Shut up, you ugly hag!

03:43.866 --> 03:45.659
What did you just call me?!

03:44.238 --> 03:45.398
Wait!

03:45.660 --> 03:47.661
My pochette!

03:48.079 --> 03:49.704
Give it back!

03:49.705 --> 03:51.957
That's my pochette!

03:51.958 --> 03:52.707
What's wrong?

03:52.708 --> 03:54.000
Wait!

03:54.001 --> 03:57.337
That dog took Pinoco-chan's pochette!

03:58.089 --> 03:59.636
I'll get it back!

04:00.132 --> 04:01.800
You guys should help too!

04:02.012 --> 04:03.176
That sounds fun.

04:03.177 --> 04:03.718
Let's go.

04:03.719 --> 04:04.552
Let's go.

04:04.929 --> 04:08.306
Wait up!

04:12.812 --> 04:14.562
Wait, you thieving dog!

04:27.118 --> 04:29.674
The puppy died.

04:30.496 --> 04:32.539
It died!

04:36.043 --> 04:37.377
It's still alive.

04:37.647 --> 04:39.754
It's not my fault.

04:40.098 --> 04:40.588
Let's get going!

04:42.216 --> 04:45.176
Geez. They're such useless boys.

04:46.012 --> 04:47.095
It's hurt badly.

04:47.305 --> 04:49.931
It'll die unless we take it to a doctor.

04:50.599 --> 04:51.725
A doctor?

04:59.817 --> 05:02.319
<i>That ringtone must be Pinoco.</i>

05:05.197 --> 05:07.917
Doc! Help!

05:08.159 --> 05:09.034
What?

05:09.035 --> 05:09.993
What happened?

05:09.994 --> 05:13.788
She was struck by a truck in front of the park!

05:13.789 --> 05:17.133
She'll die if you don't come here now!

05:17.376 --> 05:18.335
All right, Pinoco.

05:18.336 --> 05:18.999
I'll be right there.

05:30.639 --> 05:32.388
Doc, the puppy is...

05:32.504 --> 05:35.148
Please save her!

05:38.105 --> 05:40.065
Why didn't you tell me she was a dog first?

05:40.066 --> 05:41.436
Because...

05:41.609 --> 05:45.612
Remember? I'm not a veterinarian.

05:45.613 --> 05:49.991
But you operated on that Iriomote cat the other day!

05:50.493 --> 05:52.369
That's because it was an endangered species.

05:52.553 --> 05:56.331
We should help this poor stray dog too.

05:56.686 --> 05:59.876
But this dog stole something from you.

05:59.877 --> 06:02.796
Why do we have to save a thieving dog?

06:02.997 --> 06:07.133
But she was hit by a car because I was chasing her.

06:07.134 --> 06:09.427
It'll be my fault if she dies!

06:09.428 --> 06:10.720
Fine!

06:10.721 --> 06:12.806
I'll do it, so be quiet already!

06:15.434 --> 06:18.728
I hope that dog will get well.

06:19.066 --> 06:22.148
I'm sure she'll be fine under Dr. Black Jack's care.

06:25.569 --> 06:26.361
Um...

06:27.238 --> 06:28.696
Is this your bag?

06:28.697 --> 06:29.385
Yes.

06:29.385 --> 06:30.323
Is something wrong?

06:33.202 --> 06:34.383
It's a girl.

06:35.496 --> 06:38.934
I see collar marks, so she must have been someone's pet.

06:39.458 --> 06:41.760
Maybe the owner abandoned her for some reason..

06:42.195 --> 06:44.003
Abandoned?

06:44.004 --> 06:45.046
Poor girl...

06:46.298 --> 06:47.774
This will be, difficult.

06:48.008 --> 06:50.468
Looks like the broken rib is puncturing her lung.

06:51.178 --> 06:52.470
She can't be healed?

06:52.887 --> 06:54.431
Oh, she'll be fine.

06:54.432 --> 06:56.805
But it'll take time for her to recover.

06:57.226 --> 06:58.935
She'll be fine. Just stay outside.

07:13.617 --> 07:14.659
That's it!

07:18.747 --> 07:19.789
Damn you, Pinoco.

07:26.046 --> 07:27.297
Pinoco!

07:27.298 --> 07:29.215
I'm right here.

07:29.216 --> 07:31.217
What's up with all these decorations?!

07:31.218 --> 07:34.846
I made the girl's bed all cute.

07:34.847 --> 07:37.599
You're going to let that stray dog sleep on this bed?!

07:37.788 --> 07:40.018
She is a girl, right?

07:40.019 --> 07:42.921
Why would she sleep on my bed just because she's a girl?!

07:43.281 --> 07:45.565
The wooden crate under the eaves is good enough for her!

07:46.400 --> 07:49.068
Then all the decorations will go to waste...

07:49.069 --> 07:56.159
Look at the dog in the rose garden. Bow-wow.

07:56.160 --> 08:01.498
See the red bow on her head. Isn't she pretty?!

08:03.209 --> 08:05.679
All done, Doc!

08:16.138 --> 08:18.348
Dinner's ready, puppy.

08:24.230 --> 08:25.271
Here you go.

08:30.778 --> 08:32.589
She's such a lazy dog.

08:32.988 --> 08:34.322
Hey, Doc...

08:35.690 --> 08:37.230
Notes: "Lovely" and "Princess"

08:35.908 --> 08:37.283
Which one do you like better?

08:37.910 --> 08:39.994
This dog is a princess?

08:39.995 --> 08:41.287
What's so lovely about her?

08:41.843 --> 08:43.289
Blockhead is good enough!

08:43.470 --> 08:48.474
I don't want to call her Blockhead!

08:49.065 --> 08:52.477
Hey, I have the perfect name for her.

08:52.716 --> 08:53.675
It's Largo.

08:53.989 --> 08:54.884
Largo!

08:55.427 --> 08:58.518
It's a musical term meaning "very slow."

08:58.681 --> 09:01.015
I don't care what it means.

09:01.016 --> 09:02.850
Let's call her Largo!

09:03.769 --> 09:06.688
Your name's Largo from now on.

09:07.861 --> 09:09.983
I have no intention of keeping her.

09:09.984 --> 09:12.026
We're only letting her stay here until she heals.

09:13.028 --> 09:14.804
We can't keep her?

09:14.965 --> 09:17.490
I've always wanted a pet.

09:18.033 --> 09:19.465
This is a medical facility.

09:19.743 --> 09:21.554
We can't have a pet around.

09:21.954 --> 09:23.793
Especially a thieving, little dog.

09:26.667 --> 09:29.002
Here, Largo!

09:35.634 --> 09:37.051
That's it, Largo.

09:37.052 --> 09:38.595
Very well done.

09:38.596 --> 09:41.723
But you have to go bye-bye when you get well.

09:42.683 --> 09:44.601
Pinoco-chan!

09:44.602 --> 09:46.060
Sharaku-kun...

09:46.951 --> 09:49.272
So you can't keep Largo?

09:49.273 --> 09:50.315
No.

09:50.316 --> 09:53.610
But I don't want to let her go.

09:53.611 --> 09:57.280
Maybe she stole once, but she has
lots of good things about her.

09:58.407 --> 10:02.493
About that, we've found out something incredible.

10:03.037 --> 10:04.787
Is something wrong?

10:04.788 --> 10:10.251
I knocked this pot down when I was cleaning up there.

10:11.170 --> 10:15.173
It would have been terrible if it fell on a kid.

10:17.468 --> 10:19.552
Ohmigewdness!

10:19.997 --> 10:24.354
We weren't hurt because Largo stole something from us.

10:24.784 --> 10:28.696
Maybe she's second-sighted.

10:30.606 --> 10:34.025
They say animals have more acute senses than people.

10:34.265 --> 10:35.976
Second-sighted?

10:36.083 --> 10:37.737
I'll tell Doc.

10:38.697 --> 10:41.699
Maybe that will change his mind about keeping her.

10:42.701 --> 10:48.581
So Largo stole my pochette so she could save us.

10:48.582 --> 10:49.999
That's just absurd.

10:50.000 --> 10:51.834
It happened by coincidence.

10:51.835 --> 10:53.211
But!

10:54.213 --> 10:56.631
Anyway, just what is she doing?

10:57.257 --> 10:58.591
She's cleaning.

11:03.810 --> 11:04.585
Enough.

11:04.807 --> 11:07.600
Anyway, can you go buy me a newspaper?

11:07.601 --> 11:08.851
There's an article I want to read.

11:09.853 --> 11:11.813
I'll send Largo for it.

11:12.439 --> 11:13.523
Here's the money.

11:13.524 --> 11:16.609
Buy the newspaper and bring it back here, OK?

11:39.117 --> 11:40.951
So when is the newspaper coming?

11:41.661 --> 11:43.871
It's already been two days.

11:48.617 --> 11:49.297
It's Largo!

11:49.337 --> 11:50.321
She's back!

11:50.431 --> 11:51.618
Largo!
Largo!

11:51.619 --> 11:53.996
I was so worried!

11:54.998 --> 11:56.908
Pinoco, don't let her inside!

11:58.501 --> 12:00.335
And what is this?!

12:00.336 --> 12:02.160
It's a newspaper from years ago!

12:02.380 --> 12:04.805
Really, she's a useless, stupid dog!

12:09.470 --> 12:11.390
It's turned out really badly.

12:11.597 --> 12:13.932
Can you think of a way to keep her?

12:13.933 --> 12:16.022
Did that dog get well?

12:16.983 --> 12:18.289
Kong!

12:18.646 --> 12:21.773
He's my friend, King.

12:21.950 --> 12:23.734
They're King Kong.

12:29.032 --> 12:31.408
Don't get close to a dog like that.

12:31.409 --> 12:33.452
You wouldn't want to catch any weird diseases.

12:33.684 --> 12:36.663
Largo doesn't have any weird diseases!

12:36.946 --> 12:39.082
This dog's amazing.

12:39.083 --> 12:41.460
He takes the grand prize every time at the local contest.

12:41.461 --> 12:44.087
I'm sure he'll win again tomorrow.

12:44.257 --> 12:45.839
A contest?

12:46.466 --> 12:50.010
It's not something your dog can do.

12:50.011 --> 12:51.303
Let's get going!

12:51.487 --> 12:52.760
Sheesh, those two!

12:52.820 --> 12:54.687
They really make me angry!

12:54.793 --> 12:56.387
The contest!

12:57.044 --> 13:04.357
If Largo takes the grand prize at the contest, Doc will
definitely change his mind about keeping her!

13:06.319 --> 13:08.320
That's so cute!

13:11.357 --> 13:13.533
And me too.

13:14.368 --> 13:15.370
Pinoco?!

13:15.881 --> 13:17.496
What are you doing?!

13:17.497 --> 13:21.666
Largo, your chances are getting slimmer and slimmer.

13:21.667 --> 13:25.545
If it keeps up like this, you'll have to
go bye-bye as soon as you're well.

13:26.705 --> 13:30.217
The contest tomorrow will be your last chance.

13:30.218 --> 13:36.389
If we can win second place if not the grand
prize-Doc might change his mind about keeping you.

13:41.703 --> 13:47.442
Hey Doc, can we keep Largo if
she wins third place or better?

13:47.443 --> 13:48.151
Sure.

13:48.152 --> 13:49.528
Really?!

13:49.529 --> 13:50.133
Yeah.

13:50.404 --> 13:51.988
Because I know she can't.

13:57.436 --> 13:59.538
Yes, I'm looking forward to judging it again.

14:03.292 --> 14:04.637
Pinoco-chan!

14:05.622 --> 14:06.837
We came to cheer for her.

14:06.838 --> 14:08.880
Sharaku! Wato-san!

14:09.221 --> 14:12.092
Oh, I didn't know you came to events like this too.

14:12.518 --> 14:14.553
It wasn't my choice.

14:14.554 --> 14:16.634
She forced me to come here.

14:17.181 --> 14:19.099
You seem to be doing well, Sharaku-kun.

14:20.560 --> 14:21.685
Hey you guys.

14:23.312 --> 14:25.647
Did you come to watch the contest?

14:25.879 --> 14:27.072
No.

14:27.233 --> 14:29.069
We're participating.

14:30.153 --> 14:32.112
Why are you laughing?!

14:32.613 --> 14:34.990
Your dog's participating in this contest?

14:34.991 --> 14:37.292
Good-luck getting the booby prize.

14:37.660 --> 14:40.452
What's a booby prize?

14:40.670 --> 14:43.248
It's given to the dog who got second to last place.

14:44.959 --> 14:49.045
We're going to get started with the dog show,
sponsored by the Bow-Wow School.

15:12.153 --> 15:14.613
Largo! What are you doing?

15:18.159 --> 15:19.117
Oh my...

15:19.118 --> 15:21.786
Largo, do as you're told!

15:24.582 --> 15:25.832
Largo!

15:26.209 --> 15:27.918
Largo!

15:31.756 --> 15:32.703
Largo?

15:32.965 --> 15:34.633
Where are you going?!

15:34.634 --> 15:35.425
Huh?!

15:36.496 --> 15:37.594
Thief!

15:37.595 --> 15:39.610
Somebody catch that dog!

15:39.847 --> 15:41.473
Largo!

15:41.891 --> 15:43.016
Give it back!

15:43.017 --> 15:44.935
Largo! Wait!

16:02.495 --> 16:02.953
Here.

16:04.872 --> 16:07.249
Today's dog show is canceled!

16:07.250 --> 16:08.333
Canceled!

16:09.543 --> 16:10.752
No way!

16:11.020 --> 16:13.838
Canceled!

16:18.552 --> 16:23.405
If she hadn't canceled the contest, I know
Largo would've won third place.

16:24.301 --> 16:27.394
I can't keep Largo?

16:27.395 --> 16:28.770
Of course not.

16:28.771 --> 16:32.482
She's got such bad habits I might even chase
her away before she's even healed!

16:36.112 --> 16:37.946
Looks like we have a guest.

16:42.034 --> 16:44.786
I'm the ambassador from the Republic of Kainan.

16:44.787 --> 16:49.416
Thank you very much for saving
our president the other day.

16:51.991 --> 16:57.636
We came today to show how grateful
the president is with this.

17:00.494 --> 17:01.827
It's so pretty!

17:03.656 --> 17:06.123
Can I really have this?

17:06.554 --> 17:09.585
We'd be very pleased if you like it.

17:12.589 --> 17:14.840
It's so pretty.

17:14.841 --> 17:15.883
Put it away in the cabinet.

17:15.884 --> 17:17.301
OK.

17:30.023 --> 17:30.940
Largo!

17:33.735 --> 17:36.320
Largo! What are you doing?!

17:36.321 --> 17:37.752
Wait! Largo!

17:39.527 --> 17:41.508
Why you little scumbag!

17:41.703 --> 17:43.655
Pinoco, see that?

17:43.930 --> 17:46.687
This dog is a helpless thief!

17:47.028 --> 17:47.897
Dummy!

17:47.898 --> 17:49.523
You dummy!

17:51.985 --> 17:54.219
Now, put it back where it belongs!

17:54.446 --> 17:56.845
And get out of this house as soon as you do!

18:00.327 --> 18:01.285
Do it now!

18:24.976 --> 18:25.976
It's an earthquake!

18:25.977 --> 18:26.560
A big one too!

18:32.901 --> 18:34.990
Doc! The house is...

18:39.366 --> 18:40.199
Largo!

18:41.368 --> 18:42.576
It's not safe in there!

18:42.577 --> 18:43.827
But Largo is...

18:44.621 --> 18:46.163
Largo!

18:47.499 --> 18:50.209
Between the dog's and your own
life, which is more important?!

18:50.210 --> 18:51.794
Doc, you dummy!

18:51.795 --> 18:53.796
You still don't see it?!

18:53.797 --> 18:58.676
If we had stayed inside, it would've been us!

18:58.821 --> 19:03.837
Largo stole it so she could save us!

19:05.156 --> 19:07.226
It's always been like that!

19:08.395 --> 19:13.065
Largo's been stealing to save everyone!

19:21.324 --> 19:24.743
<i>Was I mistaken about Largo?</i>

19:29.499 --> 19:30.791
Largo!

19:31.835 --> 19:33.787
Where are you, Largo?!

19:34.045 --> 19:34.837
Largo!

19:34.838 --> 19:36.874
Where are you, Largo?!

19:42.887 --> 19:44.138
Largo!

19:44.264 --> 19:45.563
Largo!

19:46.182 --> 19:48.934
Doc, you dummy! Dummy! Dummy!

19:48.935 --> 19:52.445
She died all because of you!

19:52.731 --> 19:55.065
I'm sorry, Largo!

19:56.484 --> 19:58.277
Largo!

19:59.654 --> 20:00.571
Largo?

20:01.197 --> 20:02.197
Doc!

20:02.198 --> 20:03.350
Yeah.

20:04.075 --> 20:05.284
She's still breathing.

20:05.535 --> 20:07.494
Pinoco, there's no time to cry.

20:07.495 --> 20:08.537
Prepare for an operation right away.

20:08.834 --> 20:10.664
Can she be healed?

20:11.289 --> 20:13.997
I'll heal her no matter what it takes.

20:14.461 --> 20:15.893
I won't let her die.

20:16.296 --> 20:17.129
Hurry, Pinoco!

20:18.423 --> 20:19.965
Aye-aye!

20:28.099 --> 20:29.516
All ready!

20:31.603 --> 20:32.470
Let's begin.

20:32.470 --> 20:33.143
OK.

20:33.563 --> 20:35.124
The patient's name is Largo.

20:35.398 --> 20:37.207
She's the newest member of this family.

20:38.056 --> 20:39.485
Doc...

20:40.570 --> 20:42.923
So l promise I'll save her.

20:43.831 --> 20:44.948
Pinoco, scalpel.

20:45.450 --> 20:46.366
Here.

20:59.089 --> 21:01.715
I'm glad you got to keep Largo.

21:02.000 --> 21:04.426
She saved our lives, after all.

21:04.427 --> 21:09.598
But I have to keep my eyes on her
so she won't bother the patients.

21:09.599 --> 21:11.850
Anyway, Largo's so cool.

21:11.851 --> 21:13.310
She's an esper dog.

21:13.311 --> 21:14.311
I know.

21:14.437 --> 21:18.816
So I want to exploit her power.

21:19.149 --> 21:22.556
The grand prize is a pair of tickets to Hokkaido.

21:19.256 --> 21:22.522
Note: Raffle Ticket

21:23.071 --> 21:25.509
Largo, give me your best shot.

21:30.109 --> 21:32.389
Winner! Winner!

21:32.422 --> 21:33.863
We won!

21:33.883 --> 21:34.873
Wow!

21:34.874 --> 21:35.916
Congratulations.

21:35.917 --> 21:38.252
See, missy? You won fourth prize.

21:39.003 --> 21:40.892
Fourth?

21:41.965 --> 21:46.176
She's no esper.

21:46.177 --> 21:47.553
Sure she is.

21:48.721 --> 21:55.144
For Largo, the fourth prize, the package of steaks, is much
better than the grand prize, the trip to Hokkaido.

21:55.145 --> 21:55.702
You see?

22:01.526 --> 22:03.811
Sheesh, Largo!

22:07.079 --> 22:19.034
I love you darling. If I can be united with you,

22:07.079 --> 22:19.034
daisukuyo anata to hitotsu ni nareru no nara

22:19.152 --> 22:24.151
I couldn't be happier...

22:19.152 --> 22:24.151
konna shiawase wa naiwa...

22:25.720 --> 22:31.189
I wanted to see you forever

22:25.720 --> 22:31.189
zutto aitakute mattetano

22:31.733 --> 22:37.191
I'm laying on the grill,

22:31.733 --> 22:37.191
ami no ue ni yasashiku nekasete

22:37.795 --> 22:40.280
being heated up by you,

22:37.795 --> 22:40.280
anata ni hoterasarete

22:40.489 --> 22:48.266
so much that I change color

22:40.489 --> 22:48.266
atashi wa iro ga kawarukurai

22:48.351 --> 23:00.120
I dress up with sparkly grains of decorations

22:48.351 --> 23:00.120
kirakira hikaru tsubu no kazari de oshare

23:00.328 --> 23:12.059
I love you darling. Please love me more and more...

23:00.328 --> 23:12.059
daisukiyo motto motto atashi wo aishite

23:12.299 --> 23:23.650
I love you darling. If I can be united with you,

23:12.299 --> 23:23.650
daisukiyo anata to hitotsu no nareru no nara

23:23.836 --> 23:28.757
I couldn't be happier

23:23.836 --> 23:28.757
konna shiawase wa naiwa...

23:28.985 --> 23:33.919
How does it taste?

23:28.985 --> 23:33.918
oaji wa ikaga?

23:47.568 --> 23:48.216
Chako!

23:48.288 --> 23:49.088
Chako!

23:52.690 --> 23:54.370
Save my sister, please!

23:54.413 --> 23:57.746
He just asked for a very high fee.

23:58.223 --> 23:59.631
Well, fine!

24:02.179 --> 24:02.980
Ta-da!

24:05.444 --> 24:07.824
I'll beat him up good!

24:08.104 --> 24:10.224
Doctor, please operate on me!

24:10.464 --> 24:11.557
Operation?!

24:12.115 --> 24:14.632
Next Karte - Playing Doctor

24:15.761 --> 24:17.656
Pinoco's Diary...

24:18.769 --> 24:21.303
I'll heal her no matter what it takes.

24:21.936 --> 24:23.536
I won't let her die.

24:23.703 --> 24:24.823
Hurry, Pinoco!
